\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(i,j)\\in I\\;(b_{ij}\\leq0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(i,j)\\in I\\;(b_{ij}\\leq0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(i,j)\\in I\\;(b_{ij}\\geq0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\in\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall(i,j)\\in I\\;(b_{ij}\\geq0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.601 紧随 Theorem 13.21 的二次推论；本笔记同时明确其取负形式。对 i&lt;j，J_iJ_jq 恒为 b_ij；对 i=j 恒为零，故由该定理立即推出两条等价式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbsubmodderivative","status":"resolved","id":"83db39dc5813498b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbsubmodderivative]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$I=\\{(i,j)\\in N^2:i<j\\}$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（见 [[27-df-quadpb]]）。$c\\in\\mathbb R$，$a:N\\to\\mathbb R$，$b:I\\to\\mathbb R$，满足 $\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(q(x)=c+\\sum_{i\\in N}a_ix_i+\\sum_{(i,j)\\in I}b_{ij}x_ix_j)$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbsubmodderivative","status":"resolved","id":"83db39dc5813498b","anchor":"ref-4","t